{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36273","headline":"题故人废宅二首 一 · 方干","name":"题故人废宅二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举目凄凉入破门，鲛人一饭尚知恩。\n闲花旧识犹含笑，怪石无情更不言。\n樵叟和巢伐桃李，牧童兼草踏兰荪。\n壶觞笑咏随风去，唯有声声蜀帝魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}